<title>USA: McKesson to sell Millbrook unit.</title>
<headline>McKesson to sell Millbrook unit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>McKesson Corp said it agreed to sell its Millbrook Distribution Services Inc unit to R.A.B. Holdings Inc, an investment group.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclsoed. But the company said that the after-tax sale proceeds will approximate the book value of the business, and that the divestiture will not be dilutive to McKesson shareholders.</p>
<p>The company said the sale was part of its ongoing strategy to focus on health care and divest non-core businesses.</p>
</text>
